  "notes": "Monochrome black-and-white storefront (Shop.co Figma template). Display type is the heavy extended Integral CF in caps, paired with the soft Satoshi sans. Inputs and buttons are full pills (9999px radius) on grey #f0f0f0, and panels have a 20px radius with a 1px light border. Primary CTAs are solid black pills; 'Go to Checkout' is 60px tall with an arrow. Red is used only for discounts (-$240, -30% pills on a pale red fill) and filled trash icons. Product photos sit on a warm #f0eeed tile. The black newsletter band overlaps the boundary between the white page and the grey footer, and payment-method logos sit at the bottom right. Each cart line has a pill-shaped quantity stepper; the codebook has no entry for it, so I filed proposal quantity-stepper. The Shop mega-menu is a 2-column text grid with descriptions; no Form value fits it, so I left Form unset."
